      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofmarshallville.org/city-history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Marshallville was incorporated as a town in 1854 and later became a city in 1953.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
